# Swarm Culler (2/4 flying) cast on turn 1 with four Moxen. On turn 3 it attacks and becomes tapped: Bot1 sacrifices Mox Pearl (an
# artifact; the Culler itself is not offered, "another") and draws a card, the hand going from 3 to 4. On turn 5 the attack taps
# it again and Bot1 declines: nothing is sacrificed, no card is drawn (the hand is the 4 plus the turn's draw, 5).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Swarm Culler
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swarm Culler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot1.Attack(Swarm Culler > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Swarm Culler)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Pearl)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl = (absent)
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Attack(Swarm Culler > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = false
Bot2.Life = 16
